# Holleyman
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Thirty short rounds; a heavy single clean every round keeps the pace honest.
note: Intermediate option: 25 rounds. Scale the rounds so the work stays under about 25 minutes.
30 rounds for time
  5 Wall ball 20/14 lb
  3 Handstand push-up
  1 Power clean 225/155 lb

Scaled:
  Handstand push-up -> Push-up
  Power clean 155/105 lb
